","VerseNumber":85,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"لَأَمۡلَأَنَّ جَهَنَّمَ مِنكَ وَمِمَّن تَبِعَكَ مِنۡهُمۡ أَجۡمَعِينَ","TajweedText":"لَأَمْلَأَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ جَهَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َمَ مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نك</tajweed>َ وَمِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ت</tajweed>َبِعَكَ مِنْهُمْ أَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>مَع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٨٥</span>","End":"٨٥","PageNumber":458,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":395,"MaqraNumber":183,"HizbNumber":46,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":38,"SurahIndex":"038","VerseNumber":86,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قُلۡ مَآ أَسۡـَٔلُكُمۡ عَلَيۡهِ مِنۡ أَجۡرٖ وَمَآ أَنَا۠ مِنَ ٱلۡمُتَكَلِّفِينَ","TajweedText":"قُلْ م<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَسْــَٔلُكُمْ عَلَيْهِ مِنْ أَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رٍ و</tajweed>َم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَنَا۟ مِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُتَكَلِّف<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٨٦</span>","End":"٨٦","PageNumber":458,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":395,"MaqraNumber":183,"HizbNumber":46,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":38,"SurahIndex":"038","VerseNumber":87,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنۡ هُوَ إِلَّا ذِكۡرٞ لِّلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","TajweedText":"إِنْ هُوَ إِلَّا ذِكْ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>رٌ ل</tajweed>ِّلْعَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٨٧</span>","End":"٨٧","PageNumber":458,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":395,"MaqraNumber":183,"HizbNumber":46,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":38,"SurahIndex":"038","VerseNumber":88,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلَتَعۡلَمُنَّ نَبَأَهُۥ بَعۡدَ حِينِۭ","TajweedText":"وَلَ